{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/215985-darkling-encounter","id":215985,"title":"Darkling encounter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-01T10:38:02-07:00","id":215985,"title":"Darkling encounter?","content":"I was browsing the blog &quot;I work at a public library&quot;, where librarians submit odd or funny things that happen to them. <a href=\"http://iworkatapubliclibrary.com/post/82471903638/fast-it-all-happened-so\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> entry made me think of Changeling:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A lady walked up to me to ask for help making copies. She was in her 80s, very tall, and gaunt, with watery eyes and yellowed fingernails. I was talking with her about how many copies she needed when the following happened in very quick succession: 1) a dead housefly fell from her hair and landed on the folder she was holding, 2) she saw it and said \u201coops!\u201d, 3) she scooped up the fly and popped it into her mouth, and 4) she told me she needed three double-sided copies. </div> </div> </div>Instant NPC!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3629-bibliomancer","name":"Bibliomancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}